<title>USA: Eagle Food Centers Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Eagle Food Centers Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN, Ill. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periods ended Feb 1,</p>
<p>			  1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  $0.05	   loss   $0.56</p>
<p> Net profit	 531	    loss    6,275</p>
<p> Revs		 260,812		  282,888</p>
<p>	  12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  $0.29	    loss  $1.68</p>
<p> Net profit	 3,248	   loss   18,692</p>
<p> Revs		 1,014,889		1,023,664</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding charges in both periods for store closing and asset revaluation, the most recent fiscal year would have resulted in net earnings of $4.9 million compared with a net loss of $11.5 million in the prior fiscal year.</p>
